      <p>For the Xperia PRO-I we opened with a first look film, A Cinematographer's Dream, then kept the story going for six months: travel vlogs, mobile photography, four highlight videos, and 50+ images distributed across AOV's channels, from posts and Stories to Reels, IGTV, and YouTube. That launch alone made 3.6 million impressions and 569 thousand actions, with an engagement rate more than triple what industry standards consider high.</p>
